Miller R, Korenbrot T, Luft H. The impact of financial incentives on quality of health care. Milbank Q. 1998;76(4):649&#x02013;86. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9879306</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Armour</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Pitts</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Maclean</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>The effect of explicit financial incentives on physician behavior</article-title><source>Arch Intern Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>161</volume><fpage>1261</fpage><lpage>1266</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/archinte.161.10.1261</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Armour B, Pitts M, Maclean R, et al. The effect of explicit financial incentives on physician behavior. Arch Intern Med. 2001;161:1261&#x02013;6. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11371253</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bateman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Donaldson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A prescribing incentive scheme for non-fundholding general practices: an observational study</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>1996</year><volume>313</volume><fpage>533</fpage><lpage>538</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Bateman D, Campbell M, Donaldson L, Roberts S, Smith J. A prescribing incentive scheme for non-fundholding general practices: an observational study. BMJ. 1996;313:533&#x02013;8. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8789983</pu